											<i class="w-fill"></i>
											<span class="w-boldv"><b>168</b></span>
											<span class="w-end"><b class="w-small">Pune air</b><span>Unhealthy</span></span>
										</div>
										<!-- Shortcuts in Shape, 4×1: each button a Material shape in the theme's colors in turn, its label under it -->
